Z||000006||DXR_DAD||05-24-2000||12:49 AM|||| <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=5080942&p=20941720&Sequence=1" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=5080942&p=20941720&Sequence=1</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=5080942&p=20938403&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=5080942&p=20938403&Sequence=2</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=5080942&p=20941718&Sequence=1" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=5080942&p=20941718&Sequence=1</A> <P><BR>It is a short shifter (made by me) The pic is of one I'm doing for a friend 4 1/4, 5/8 stainless steel rod to replace the stock L looking thing, the after market knob fits the 5/8 rod.<P>This is my 2nd set of carbon fiber dash plates, the first were not clear coated<BR>these are, as you can see the shine in the photo.<P>the first process can be found here:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com/cf.html" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroproject.com/cf.html</A> <P>The clear coat process will be there soon<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723595&p=21451557&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723595&p=21451557&Sequence=2</A> ||||reg||1
